"Step 4 · Choosing the SDLC model": "ধাপ 4 · SDLC model বাছাই",
"Criterion": "মানদণ্ড",
"Core requirements known": "মূল requirement জানা",
"Yes": "হ্যাঁ",
"No": "না",
"Users give feedback during development": "Development চলাকালীন ব্যবহারকারীরা মতামত দেন",
